# The HTTP tests in a page: haxe build-web.hxml -> web/app.js, beside web/index.html; serve web/ and open it with ?server=<a test server's
# URL>. window.helixResult holds {passed, checks, failures, answers} when they're done. tools/platform_checks.py starts the server.
-lib helix-platform
-D helix-company=helix
-D helix-product=platform-http-tests
-cp .
-main HttpTests
-dce full
-js web/app.js
